      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NETWORK: one VNet, four NSG-associated subnets\nsnet-loadtest | snet-pe | snet-flex-integ | snet-premium-integ\nPrivate DNS zones are linked to the VNet; PaaS apps/storage are not hosted in these subnets.",
      "originalText": "NETWORK: one VNet, four NSG-associated subnets\nsnet-loadtest | snet-pe | snet-flex-integ | snet-premium-integ\nPrivate DNS zones are linked to the VNet; PaaS apps/storage are not hosted in these subnets.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
