      "text": "IMPORTANT DESIGN CHOICE\nThe \"premium\" side is Dedicated, not Elastic Premium.\nKeyless/private storage rules exclude the EP Azure Files\nshared-key content mount in this demo.\n\nBlue = private request/storage path; purple = telemetry.",
